  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "during installation of the SIGMATRIP DC Analog Trip Unit that the stranded wires that were terminated in the harness protruded in such a manner they were able to short to an adjacent wire in the harness. The short occurred in breaker LA08-2 on the A phase current transformer (CT)/sensor harness. Siemens and Framatome do not currently have a verification step/QA/QC check or any instruction for inspecting the wires connected in the wiring harnesses",
    "cause_code": "B",
    "category": "Design/Manufacturing/Installation",
    "theme": "inadequate vendor QA/QC for wire harness installation causing internal short",
    "provisional": false
  },
